### MaterialLots — UPDATE PUT, editable fields only (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1
@plantId = 1
@materialId = 1

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-RIO-PET-202610-100",
  "plantId": {{plantId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "description": "Lote de PET compactado",
  "status": "active"
}

### MaterialLots — PUT with weightKg (expects 400 Bad Request: stock changes only with weighings and sales)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-RIO-PET-202610-100",
  "plantId": {{plantId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "weightKg": 9999
}
